{"ID":"20240206105121-m2gl1bw","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240206105121-m2gl1bw","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105121-m2gl1bw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105129-2bhecpj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607113545-86gbhsc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619100101-gt4ikba\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"051卷柏（九死还魂草）","type":"doc","updated":"20240806103521"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206105129-2bhecpj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105129-2bhecpj","updated":"20240206105133"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于广东、福建、湖南、四川等地。\n【性状】\t卷柏：卷缩似拳状，长3"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10cm。 枝丛生，扁而有分枝，绿色或棕黄色，向内卷曲，枝上密生鳞片状小叶，叶先端具长芒，中叶 (腹叶) 两行，卵状矩圆形，斜向上排列，叶缘膜质，有不整齐的细锯齿。背叶 (侧叶) 背面的膜质边缘常呈棕黑色。基部残留棕色至棕褐色须根，散生或聚生成短干状。质脆，易折断。无臭，味淡。\n垫状卷柏：须根多散生。中叶 (腹叶) 两行，卵状披针形，直向上排列。叶片左右两侧不等，内缘较平直，外缘常因内折而加厚，呈全缘状。\n【性味】\t辛，平。\n【功效】\t活血通经。用于经闭痛经，癓瘕痞块，跌扑损伤。外用可治刀伤。卷柏炭化瘀止血。用于吐血，崩漏，便血，脱肛。"}]},{"ID":"20240206105124-6urcct7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105124-6urcct7","updated":"20240206105124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206105124-t4mo7q6.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619095030-g8uq275","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619095030-g8uq275","updated":"20240806095545"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 639px;","style":"width: 629px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"卷柏"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/卷柏-20240619095030-ki4wflx.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 629px;\" parent-style=\"width: 639px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619095230-xazyx8f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619095230-xazyx8f","updated":"20240806103036"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 388px;","style":"width: 378px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"卷柏 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/卷柏 8-20240806103029-qbymuoh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 378px;\" parent-style=\"width: 388px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"卷柏 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/卷柏 1-20240806095917-c0u9471.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240806095712-pofb8xr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806095712-pofb8xr","updated":"20240806103044"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 346px;","style":"width: 336px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"卷柏3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/卷柏3-20240619100023-jidp0yf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 336px;\" parent-style=\"width: 346px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 740px;","style":"width: 730px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"卷柏"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/卷柏-20240806095712-l4jr37v.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 730px;\" parent-style=\"width: 740px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240806103156-omdq422","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806103156-omdq422","updated":"20240806103237"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"卷柏 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/卷柏 9-20240806103156-1aczmkc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 479px;","style":"width: 469px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"卷柏 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/卷柏 10-20240806103237-efgg00b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 469px;\" parent-style=\"width: 479px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240806103347-5swe9jy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806103347-5swe9jy","updated":"20240806103521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 456px;","style":"width: 446px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"卷柏 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/卷柏 12-20240806103521-qb15lua.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 446px;\" parent-style=\"width: 456px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 798px;","style":"width: 788px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"卷柏 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/卷柏 11-20240806103347-5bc59n9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 788px;\" parent-style=\"width: 798px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240806102430-5zi3w5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806102430-5zi3w5d","updated":"20240806102438"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 682px;","style":"width: 672px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"卷柏 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/卷柏 6-20240806102430-xccnf7f.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 672px;\" parent-style=\"width: 682px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 570px;","style":"width: 560px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"卷柏 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/卷柏 5-20240806101933-6k97p60.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 560px;\" parent-style=\"width: 570px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240806101335-m5fw8y6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806101335-m5fw8y6","updated":"20240806101413"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 637px;","style":"width: 627px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"卷柏 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/卷柏 3-20240806101335-azjchcp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 627px;\" parent-style=\"width: 637px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 637px;","style":"width: 627px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"卷柏 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/卷柏 4-20240806101413-fl2rs7b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 627px;\" parent-style=\"width: 637px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​​"}]},{"ID":"20240619095918-vs4bv29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619095918-vs4bv29","updated":"20240806101240"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：卷柏生于悬崖峭壁之上，采摘不易；"}]},{"ID":"20240806101446-z5afete","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806101446-z5afete","updated":"20240806102203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"二注：卷柏生命力极其顽强，就算晒干了也可以复活（即便做成标本十一年，遇水后都可以复活），天气干旱没有雨水时它就把自己卷成一团，等到雨季之后它才会将叶子展开；人工养殖的没有该特性，死了也没法复活；"}]},{"ID":"20240806102236-dd63lf3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806102236-dd63lf3","updated":"20240806102352"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"三注：据说当天气非常干旱的时候，卷柏会自己连根拔起，借助风的力量滚到有水的地方扎根；"}]},{"ID":"20240616115954-97fl6r1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616115954-97fl6r1"}},{"ID":"20240616122324-qnlg0fe","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616122324-qnlg0fe","updated":"20240616122328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616122324-o1byi43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122324-o1byi43","updated":"20240616122324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛温。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122324-ac5iqbw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122324-ac5iqbw","updated":"20240616122324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生山谷。主五脏邪气，女子阴中寒热，痛，症瘕，血闭，绝子。久服轻身，和颜色。一名万岁。生山谷石间。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122324-uixe85b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122324-uixe85b","updated":"20240616122324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：卷柏，神农辛，桐君雷公甘（《御览》引云，一名豹足，一名求股，一名万岁，一名神枝，时，生山谷）。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122324-t0ilu9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122324-t0ilu9h","updated":"20240616122324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名豹足，一名求股，一名交时，生常山，五月七月采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122324-iz39aws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122324-iz39aws","updated":"20240616122324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《范子计然》云：卷柏，出三辅。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122332-ubi9xii","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616122332-ubi9xii"}},{"ID":"20240616122333-t9ytphq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616122333-t9ytphq","updated":"20240616122338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240616122333-cefhh6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122333-cefhh6b","updated":"20240616122333"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，平，微寒，无毒．止咳逆，治脱肛，散淋结，头中风眩，痿蹶，强阴，益精．久服令人好容体．一名豹足，一名求股，一名交时．生常山．五月、七月采，阴干．"}]},{"ID":"20240616122333-f4opbpc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122333-f4opbpc","updated":"20240616122341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶卷柏，味辛，温．主五脏邪气，女子阴中寒热痛，症瘕血闭绝子．久服轻身，和颜色。一名万岁。生山谷石间。"}]},{"ID":"20240616115954-9j3ec4y","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616115954-9j3ec4y"}},{"ID":"20240616122254-iv7sjks","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616122254-iv7sjks","updated":"20240616122259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240616122254-1ogze0l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122254-1ogze0l","updated":"20240616122254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、甘，温、平、微寒，无毒。主治五脏邪气，女子阴中寒热痛，症瘕，血闭，绝子。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122254-lu8rp86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122254-lu8rp86","updated":"20240616122254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"止咳逆，治脱肛，散淋结，头中风眩，痿蹶，强阴益精。久服轻身，和颜色，令人好容体。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122254-82r2tnn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122254-82r2tnn","updated":"20240616122254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名万岁，一名豹足，一名求股，一名交时。生常山山谷石间。五月、七月采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122254-43ah2n3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122254-43ah2n3","updated":"20240616122254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今出近道。丛生石土上，细叶似柏，卷屈状如鸡足，青黄色。用之，去下近石有沙土处。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122521-i9rdi0q","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616122521-i9rdi0q"}},{"ID":"20240616122522-ehlpt8v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616122522-ehlpt8v","updated":"20240616122526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏《本草乘雅半偈》"}]},{"ID":"20240616122522-y9l4d60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122522-y9l4d60","updated":"20240616122522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经上品）"}]},{"ID":"20240616122522-x34lwno","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122522-x34lwno","updated":"20240616122522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"春秋二分，阴阳离也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122522-yuau402","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122522-yuau402","updated":"20240616122522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】辛平，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122522-kw70mx8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122522-kw70mx8","updated":"20240616122522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主五脏邪气，女子阴中寒热痛，症瘕血闭绝子。久服轻身，和颜色。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122522-x7w1z1s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122522-x7w1z1s","updated":"20240616122522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【核】曰∶出常山山谷，关陕、沂、兖亦有之。丛生石上，春分宿根再发，高三五寸，细叶似侧柏，屈藏如鸡足根紫赤多须。六七月采取阴干。修治，以盐水煮半日，再以井水煮半日"}]},{"ID":"20240616122522-pfz17pn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122522-pfz17pn","updated":"20240616122600"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"[]曰∶叶形似柏，屈曲拳挛，因名卷柏。一名豹足、求股，亦取象形。一名万岁、长生不死草，言根栖岩石，能耐岁寒。一名交时，言春分始发，时值阴离于阳，能与阳相交合。故主五脏至阴之地，为邪所薄，及女子阴中寒热，症瘕，血闭绝子。此正阴不与阳，功能使阴气起亟，阳气前通，交相匹配。更能使阳气外溢，故和色，轻身，所谓阳在外，阴之使也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122545-zlzl62f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122545-zlzl62f","updated":"20240616122603"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"[]愚按：之颐止述《本经》主治耳，然其所说时值阴离于阳，能使阳相交合，以明主治之义，可谓得未曾有矣。盖《本经》止言女子之主治而不及丈夫者，正为女子以血为主，如所谓癥瘕，血闭绝子，正阴不得阳之配，以致于斯，不漫同于阴虚之血闭绝子也。即《别录》谓其强阴益精，皆属此义。故云止咳逆，治脱肛，散淋结，头中风眩，痿躃等证，非臆说也。再合于《日华子》暖水脏一语，乃知卢氏所说信而有征，且《准绳》治咳嗽血，唾血及脏毒下血，并用兹味。试推求脏毒二字，以参卢氏五脏至阴之地为邪所薄数语，乃知五脏至阴之地不得阳以和而行之，其为阴毒更有大焉者尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122358-h1i679c","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616122358-h1i679c"}},{"ID":"20240616122359-akqkh6l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616122359-akqkh6l","updated":"20240616122410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240616122359-pqb30i6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122359-pqb30i6","updated":"20240616122412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名豹足，一名求股，一名万岁，一名长生不死草。出常山山谷，关陕沂兖亦有之。丛生石上，春分宿根再发，高三五寸，细叶似侧柏，屈藏如鸡足，根紫赤多须。六七月采取，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122359-to2nqls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122359-to2nqls","updated":"20240616122359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味辛平。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122359-kcq1853","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122359-kcq1853","updated":"20240616122414"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主五脏邪气，女子阴中寒热痛，癥瘕血闭绝子。（此阴不得阳之配所致，非阴虚之血闭绝子也。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616122359-lqe4lwk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122359-lqe4lwk","updated":"20240616122359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"久服轻身和颜色。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122359-nv09ike","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122359-nv09ike","updated":"20240617115332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸本草止咳逆嗽血唾血头中风眩，强阴益精，疗痿躄，治脱肛，散淋结及脏毒下血。（此脏阴之地，不得阳以和而行之，为阴毒。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616122359-3uwp7b0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122359-3uwp7b0","updated":"20240616122418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下血。用卷柏、侧柏、棕榈等分。烧存性为末，每服三钱酒下，亦可饭丸服。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122359-zz9kzuj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122359-zz9kzuj","updated":"20240616122422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"远年下血。卷柏、地榆焙等分。每用一两，水一碗，煎数十沸，通口服。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122359-0afayoz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122359-0afayoz","updated":"20240616122424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕卷柏一名交时，言春分始发。时值阴离于阳，能与阳相交合，故主五脏至阴之地为邪所薄。（不得阳以和而行之之故）功能使阴气起亟，阳气前通，交相配匹。（《本经》故主癥瘕血闭绝子，及阴中寒热痛。）更能使阳气外溢，（和颜色而轻身）所谓阳在外阴之使也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122303-dzt8xll","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616122303-dzt8xll"}},{"ID":"20240616122304-l2xbxgb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616122304-l2xbxgb","updated":"20240616122308"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240616122304-donoyyo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122304-donoyyo","updated":"20240616122304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」万岁、长生不死草、豹足、求股、交时。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122304-wlnyq1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122304-wlnyq1w","updated":"20240616122304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」辛、平、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122304-0pxgy01","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122304-0pxgy01","updated":"20240616122304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」咳逆，脱肛，淋结。生用破血。炙用止血。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122314-2rnuo1h","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616122314-2rnuo1h"}},{"ID":"20240616122315-x1x8f9y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616122315-x1x8f9y","updated":"20240616122319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240616122315-2cn277b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122315-2cn277b","updated":"20240616122315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏无毒辛甘平，止血用炙破血生，血闭瘕淋阴内痛，咳逆风痿脱肛宁。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122315-5y78quw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122315-5y78quw","updated":"20240616122315"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生石上，处处有之。卷屈如鸡足，青黄色，叶似柏。生用破血，炙用止血。主妇人经闭无子， 瘕，淋结，阴中寒热痛。兼治咳逆、头中风眩、痿厥、脱肛、尸疰、五脏邪气，强阴益精，和颜色。七月采，去近石沙土处，阴干用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240616115955-9pi3jn3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616115955-9pi3jn3"}},{"ID":"20240616122106-xztik74","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616122106-xztik74","updated":"20240616122111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616122106-0c3yg5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122106-0c3yg5t","updated":"20240616122106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、甘，温、平、微寒，无毒。主五脏邪气，女子阴中寒热痛，症瘕、血闭、绝子。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122106-rs2bwdi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122106-rs2bwdi","updated":"20240616122106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"止咳逆，疗脱肛，散淋结，头中风眩，痿蹶，强阴益精。久服轻身和颜色，令人好容体。一名万岁，一名豹足，一名求股，一名交时。生常山山谷石间。五月、七月采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122106-2ztzied","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122106-2ztzied","updated":"20240616122106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今出近道。丛生石土上，细叶似柏，卷屈状如鸡足，青黄色。用之，去下近石有沙土处。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122203-ikfzeqa","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616122203-ikfzeqa"}},{"ID":"20240616122204-ctvtxb9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616122204-ctvtxb9","updated":"20240616122208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240616122204-zq2ymgb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122204-zq2ymgb","updated":"20240616122204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禀石之气，兼感人之阳气以生，故味辛、甘，温平微寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122204-lyalb6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122204-lyalb6q","updated":"20240616122204"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏，仿佛匾柏。止血用灸，去血宜生。治妇人 瘕，血闭殊功，疗男子风眩痿蹶立效，止脱肛而散淋结，驱鬼邪以除啼泣，益精强阴，镇心定魄，暖水脏育孕和颜色轻身。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122152-qq0wlk0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616122152-qq0wlk0"}},{"ID":"20240616122153-950s6ib","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616122153-950s6ib","updated":"20240616122158"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240616122153-pqiv91f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122153-pqiv91f","updated":"20240616122153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛平，无毒。桐君雷公云∶甘寒，无毒。盐水煮半日，再以井水煮半日。生用破血，炙用止血。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122153-b5cy01x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122153-b5cy01x","updated":"20240616122153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主五脏邪气，女子阴中寒热痛，症瘕血闭绝子，久服轻身和颜色。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122153-jzmu6b6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122153-jzmu6b6","updated":"20240616122153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏，足厥阴经血分药也。详《本经》诸治一皆女子经癸之病，总厥阴与冲脉之患也。《千金》大泽兰丸、紫石英、天门冬等丸皆用之。《经疏》言妊妇禁用，以其能寒子脏中血气也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122137-vlvcsl1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616122137-vlvcsl1"}},{"ID":"20240616122138-w2wgzie","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616122138-w2wgzie","updated":"20240616122147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240616122138-obnunwl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122138-obnunwl","updated":"20240616122138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（苔）生炒止血"}]},{"ID":"20240616122138-153vt6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122138-153vt6a","updated":"20240616122138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏（专入肝）。原属草部。并非侧柏。生于石上。形如拳卷。故以卷名。即俗所谓万年松者是也。气坚质浓。味甘性温。入足厥阴肝经血分。其治有分生熟。生则微寒。力能破血通经。故治症瘕淋结等症。炙则辛温。能以止血。故治肠红脱肛等症。性与侧柏叶悬殊。治亦稍异。（侧柏叶仗金气以制木。借炒黑以止血。）不可不辨。盐水煮半日。井水煮半日。焙用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122127-v6ysixh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616122127-v6ysixh"}},{"ID":"20240616122128-xjha7jv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616122128-xjha7jv","updated":"20240616122132"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240616122128-x6r3yxy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122128-x6r3yxy","updated":"20240616122128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛平．入足厥阴经．功专破血通经．治症瘕淋结．炙用辛温止血．治肠风脱肛．俗名万年松．盐水煮半日．井水煮半日焙用．"}]},{"ID":"20240616122116-0zek8iv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616122116-0zek8iv"}},{"ID":"20240616122118-snvkx2a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616122118-snvkx2a","updated":"20240616122122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240616122118-c5ykjii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122118-c5ykjii","updated":"20240616122118"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炙用辛温，善能涩肠止血。生用辛平，力可破血通经。"}]},{"ID":"20240616115955-aeiiajl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616115955-aeiiajl"}},{"ID":"20240616122038-8201lc7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616122038-8201lc7","updated":"20240616122048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616122038-f28h7e4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122038-f28h7e4","updated":"20240616122043"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏，生常山山谷间，今关、陕、沂、兖诸州亦有之。宿根紫色多须。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122038-1y75vsw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122038-1y75vsw","updated":"20240616122038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"春生苗，似柏叶而细碎，拳挛如鸡足，青黄色，高三、五寸。无花、子。多生石上。五月、七月采，阴干。去下近石有沙土处用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240616115955-sre0eid","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616115955-sre0eid"}},{"ID":"20240616122029-9tnqxb4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616122029-9tnqxb4","updated":"20240616122033"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240616122029-95vb3yh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122029-95vb3yh","updated":"20240616122029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"生用破血、炙用止血．"}]},{"ID":"20240616122029-khvwupz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122029-khvwupz","updated":"20240616122029"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生用、辛平，破血通经．治症瘕淋结．炙用、辛温止血．治肠风脱肛．生石上．卷挛如鸡足．俗名万年松．盐水煮半日．井水煮半日．焙．"}]},{"ID":"20240616122233-jh4djjx","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616122233-jh4djjx"}},{"ID":"20240616122234-y5w4bkq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616122234-y5w4bkq","updated":"20240616122239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240616122234-qwivhul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122234-qwivhul","updated":"20240616122234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛温。生山谷。主五脏邪气。女子阴中寒热痛。症瘕血闭。绝子。久服轻身。和颜色。一名万岁。生山谷石间。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122234-aen8b65","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122234-aen8b65","updated":"20240616122234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"含春时发。莳植无稽。白石凿凿。芳草萋萋。斑窥豹隐。拳屈鸡栖。长生万岁。名与柏齐。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122234-d6713ac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122234-d6713ac","updated":"20240616122234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"梁简文帝赋。草含春而色动。易。以时发也。唐书志。司苑掌园囿莳植。书。无稽之言勿听。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122234-65y93la","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122234-65y93la","updated":"20240616122234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诗。白石凿凿。楚辞。芳草生兮萋萋。晋书传。管中窥豹。时见一斑。吴普曰。一名豹足。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122234-bmhnahx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122234-bmhnahx","updated":"20240616122234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苏颂曰。春生苗似柏叶而细。拳屈如鸡足。李时珍曰。俗名长生不死草。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122219-0of68vc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616122219-0of68vc"}},{"ID":"20240616122220-gxbsgci","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616122220-gxbsgci","updated":"20240616122225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240616122220-liwr688","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122220-liwr688","updated":"20240616122220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生用破血，炙用止血"}]},{"ID":"20240616122220-9tz0q9k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122220-9tz0q9k","updated":"20240616122220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生用辛平，破血通经，治症瘕淋结。炙用辛温，止血，治肠风脱肛。"}]},{"ID":"20240616122220-2h2bt4e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616122220-2h2bt4e","updated":"20240616122220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生石上，拳挛如鸡足，俗呼万年松。凡使盐水煮半日，井水煮半日，焙用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113513-if5tr43","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607113513-if5tr43"}},{"ID":"20240607113542-egnn84n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-egnn84n","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：卷柏"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-xx6nnva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-xx6nnva","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-7iyekid","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-7iyekid","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Juǎn Bǎi"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-p8lg22h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-p8lg22h","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-q623bg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-q623bg8","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 一把抓、老虎爪、长生草、万年松"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-5o3cgb2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-5o3cgb2","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-dqsvvkw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-dqsvvkw","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" HERBA SELAGINELLAE"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-3wt1ikq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-3wt1ikq","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-2ixggra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-2ixggra","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为卷柏科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"卷柏"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Selaginella tamariscina （Beauv.）Spring 或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"垫状卷柏"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Selaginella pulvinata （HooK.et Grev.）Maxim.的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全草"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。全年均可采收，除去须根及泥沙，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-f7iuhe4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-f7iuhe4","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-huit064","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-huit064","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 卷柏：本品卷缩似拳状，长3～10cm。枝丛生，扁而有分枝，绿色或棕黄色，向内卷曲，枝上密生鳞片状小叶，叶先端具长芒，中叶（腹叶）两行，卵状矩圆形，斜向上排列，叶缘膜质，有不整齐的细锯齿。背叶（侧叶）背面的膜质边缘常呈棕黑色。基部残留棕色至棕褐色须根，散生或聚生成短干状。质脆，易折断。无臭，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-556cykm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-556cykm","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"垫状卷柏：须根多散生。中叶（腹叶）两行，卵状披针形，直向上排列。叶片左右两侧不等，内缘较平直,外缘常因内折而加厚，呈全缘状。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-nm9hjq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-nm9hjq8","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-07ofycr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-07ofycr","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-8tbrrs4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-8tbrrs4","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-tee80yo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-tee80yo","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 卷柏：除去残留须根及杂质，洗净，切段，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-kpgsfsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-kpgsfsk","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"卷柏炭：取净卷柏，照炒炭法（附录Ⅱ D）炒至表面显焦黑色。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-9nk8516","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-9nk8516","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-ul6fm59","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-ul6fm59","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 取本品粉末2g，加甲醇50ml，加热回流1小时，滤过，滤液蒸干，残渣加无水乙醇3ml使溶解，作为供试品溶液。另取卷柏对照药材2g，同法制成对照药材溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录Ⅵ B）试验，吸取上述两种溶液各3μl，分别点于同一以羧甲基纤维素钠为黏合剂的硅胶G薄层板上，以异丙醇-浓氨试液-水（13：1：1）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，喷以2％三氯化铝甲醇溶液，置紫外光灯（365nm）下检视。供试品色谱中，在与对照药材色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的荧光斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-zcs4atq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-zcs4atq","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-mdbw67o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-mdbw67o","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肝、心经。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-u6zqstj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-u6zqstj","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-upiy0xm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-upiy0xm","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-zehcdkt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-zehcdkt","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-cqd8bn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-cqd8bn5","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇慎用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-isx1bsr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-isx1bsr","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-8h93dn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-8h93dn1","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 活血通经。用于经闭痛经。癓瘕痞块，跌扑损伤。卷柏炭化瘀止血。用于吐血，崩漏，便血，脱肛。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-ewrvham","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-ewrvham","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-w8poaxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-w8poaxv","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 4.5～9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-j1eha7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-j1eha7y","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-2hzcj8y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-2hzcj8y","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-ou41z2g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-ou41z2g","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：卷柏"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-yyr3q0c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-yyr3q0c","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-kx0zxv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-kx0zxv1","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Juǎn Bǎi"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-jw2wr2g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-jw2wr2g","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-y0ji1z1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-y0ji1z1","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 豹足、求股、神投时（《吴普本草》），交时（《别录》），石莲花、回阳草（《滇南本草》），不死草（《滇南本草图说》），长生不死草（《纲目》），万年松（《本草原始》），长生草（《花镜》），石花（《盛京通志》），还魂草（《分类草药性》），九死还魂草（《现代实用中药》），见水还阳草（《浙扛中药手册》），佛手草、万年青（《东北药植志》），老虎爪（《河北药材》），山卷柏、打不死（《南宁市药物志》），铁拳头、岩松（《闽东本草》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-wbb1t82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-wbb1t82","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-2n3bqyd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-2n3bqyd","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为卷柏科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"卷柏"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"全草"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。春、秋均可采收，但以春季采者色绿质嫩为佳。采后剪去须根，酌留少许根茎，去净泥土，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-c9op3dg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-c9op3dg","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-lfkc603","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-lfkc603","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生于岩石上。分布广东、广西、福建、台湾、浙江、江苏、江西、湖南、陕西，河北、山东、辽宁、吉林等地。全国大部分地区均产。主产山东、辽宁、河北。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-w47v8mt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-w47v8mt","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-e6b6bip","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-e6b6bip","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 多年生草本，高5～15厘米。主茎短成长，直立，下着须根。各枝丛生，直立，干后拳卷，密被覆瓦状叶，各枝扇状分枝至2～3回羽状分枝。叶小，异型，交互排列；侧叶披针状钻形，长约3毫米，基部龙骨状，先端有长芒，近轴的一边全缘，宽膜质，远轴的一边膜质缘极狭，有微锯齿；中叶两行，卵圆披针形，长2毫米，先端有长芒，斜向，左右两侧不等，边缘有微锯齿，中脉在叶上面下陷。孢子囊穗生于枝顶，四棱形；孢子叶三角形，先端有长芒，边缘有宽的膜质；孢子囊肾形，大小孢子的排列不规则。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-472ozcw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-472ozcw","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-6pkts48","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-6pkts48","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥全草，全体卷缩成团，似拳形，有时似扁球形状，大小不一，一般长5～10厘米。枝叶丛生，形扁有分枝，绿色或棕黄色，向内卷曲，枝上密生鳞片状小叶。质脆，易折断。基部残留少数簇生的须根。无臭，无味。以绿色、叶多、完整不碎者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-fn58kfb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-fn58kfb","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-3936grq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-3936grq","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含黄酮、酚性成分、氨基酸、海藻糖等多糖类、少量鞣质。黄酮成分有芹菜素、穗花杉双黄酮、扁柏双黄酮和异柳杉素。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-1z0t4rn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-1z0t4rn","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-42ztnkk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-42ztnkk","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 卷柏炭:取洁净的卷柏，置锅内用武火炒至外表现焦黑色，内呈焦黄色，喷淋清水，取出，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-mxqtibe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-mxqtibe","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-tlhn22k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-tlhn22k","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经疏》:\"入足厥阴、少阴血分。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-f4jit9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-f4jit9u","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-dwc6fyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-dwc6fyb","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛，平。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-5n8jwos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-5n8jwos","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》:\"味辛，温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-iwv2b5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-iwv2b5e","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》:\"甘，平微寒，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-hjwj1kf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-hjwj1kf","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草备要》:\"生用辛，平；炙用辛，温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-j6gwa1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-j6gwa1x","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《广西中药志》:\"味淡微涩，性微寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-viwzo8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-viwzo8l","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-h7wq2gb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-h7wq2gb","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-ef9kfla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-ef9kfla","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经疏》:\"孕妇禁用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-om2yx5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-om2yx5z","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草汇言》:\"非血有瘀蓄，或不因瘀蓄而致疾者，不可轻用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-mrzzofd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-mrzzofd","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-11e3rtm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-11e3rtm","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生用破血，炒用止血。生用治经闭、症瘕，跌打损伤，腹痛，哮喘；炒炭用治吐血，便血，尿血，脱肛。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-dv126cm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-dv126cm","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》:\"主五脏邪气，女子阴中寒热痛、症瘕、血闭、绝子。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-czygk4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-czygk4d","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》:\"止咳逆，治脱肛，散淋结，头中风眩，痿蹶，强阴益精。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-ai78an7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-ai78an7","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》:\"治月经不通。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-jlsccto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-jlsccto","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》:\"镇心，除面皯，头风，暖水脏。生用破血，炙用止血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-2zze5kp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-2zze5kp","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《分类草药性》:\"治跌打损伤，行气，炒黑止吐血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-91t7r6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-91t7r6h","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《现代实用中药》:\"治尿血。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-mx7uaeh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-mx7uaeh","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦《安徽药材》:\"外用可治刀伤。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-80r4fd4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-80r4fd4","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧《南宁市药物志》:\"治热性肠出血及子宫出血，外用接骨。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-jqh2ade","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-jqh2ade","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-n9567dm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-n9567dm","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服:煎汤，0.5～3钱；浸酒或入丸、散。外用:捣敷或研末撒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-eegk764","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-eegk764","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-zuizkmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-zuizkmr","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治妇人血闭成瘕，寒热往来，子嗣不育者:卷柏四两，当归二两（俱浸酒炒），白术、牡丹皮各二两，白芍药一两，川芎五钱。分作七剂，水煎服；或炼蜜为丸，每早服四钱，白汤送。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-k31spzb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-k31spzb","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治跌打损伤，局部疼痛:鲜卷柏每次一两（干五钱）。每日一次，煎服。（《泉州本草》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-7zqya1y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-7zqya1y","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治腹痛、喘累及吐血:卷柏、小血藤、白花草、地胡椒。用酒泡-周，中午空腹服。（《四川中药志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-2hkdgs9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-2hkdgs9","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治胃痛:垫状卷柏二两。水煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-bpatg7u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-bpatg7u","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治哮喘:垫状卷柏、马鞭草各五钱。水煎服，冰糖为引。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-6d5zil9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-6d5zil9","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治癫痫:垫状卷柏二两，淡竹叶卷心一两，冰糖二两。水煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-lwy8r8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-lwy8r8b","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治吐血、便血、尿血:㈠垫状卷柏（炒焦）一两，瘦猪肉二两。水炖，服汤食肉。㈡垫状卷柏（炒焦）一两，仙鹤草一两。水煎服。（④方以下出《江西草药》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-tq0nd4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-tq0nd4d","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治大肠下血:卷柏、侧柏、棕榈等分。烧存性为末。每服三钱，酒下；也可饭丸服。（《仁存堂经验方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-97thpoh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-97thpoh","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治肠毒下血:卷柏、嫩黄芪各等分。为末，米饮调。每服三钱。（《本草汇言》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-gcgrflm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-gcgrflm","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治血崩、白带:卷柏五钱。水煎服。（《湖南药物志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-eoum1tw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-eoum1tw","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾治汤火伤:鲜卷柏捣烂敷。（《湖南药物志》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-v0b73o5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-v0b73o5","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-y6d5plt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-y6d5plt","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 用于婴儿断脐止血：取卷柏叶洗净，烘干研末，高压消毒后，贮瓶固封。在血管钳的帮助下断脐，断端撒上药粉0.5～1.0克，1～3分钟后松开血管钳，即能达到止血的目的。临床观察273例，成功270例，无效3例。认为本品不仅有良好的止血作用，而且有消炎及收敛作用。在成功病例中，脐部均较用线结扎者干燥，无臭味，尚未发现感染或其他副作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-ec8pp5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-ec8pp5r","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-0ap3cf2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-0ap3cf2","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草求真》:\"卷柏，其治有分生熟。生则微寒，力能破血通经，故治症瘕淋结等症；炙则辛温，能以止血，故治肠红脱肛等症。性与侧柏叶悬殊，治亦稍异，不可不辨。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-peaoif8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-peaoif8","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"备注"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-48uqwos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-48uqwos","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 除上述品种外，尚有垫状卷柏的全草亦同等入药。外形与上种相似，根散生。茎自基部分枝，丛生。中叶先端直向，形成2平行线，叶缘厚，全缘。分布四川、云南、西藏、广西、广东、江西、湖北、河南、河北等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-o2lymv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-o2lymv7","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-xgppbjn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-xgppbjn","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-sz23k9u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-sz23k9u","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》：卷柏"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-f5xtnu2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-f5xtnu2","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-3x576tm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-3x576tm","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Juǎn Bǎi"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-y53g5ui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-y53g5ui","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-q74ud4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-q74ud4v","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 豹足、求股、神投时、交时、石莲花、回阳草、不死草、长生不死草、万年松、长生草、石花、还魂草、九死还魂草、见水还阳草、佛手草、万年青、老虎爪、山拳柏、打不死、铁拳头、岩松、卷柏叶、卷柏炭、万岁、一把抓、大还魂草、回生草、含生草、地面草"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-me0gag5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-me0gag5","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-k4qpajr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-k4qpajr","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Tamariskoid Spikemoss Herb， Herb of Tamariskoid Spikemoss"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-1z9w2mq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-1z9w2mq","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-f7jl875","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-f7jl875","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-etik1w6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-etik1w6","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-hx5lff8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-hx5lff8","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为卷柏科植物卷柏的全草。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-whs70nl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-whs70nl","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Selaginella tamariscina(Beauv.) Spring[Stachygynandrum tamariscinum Beauv.]2.Selaginella pulvinata(Hook.et Grev.)Maxim.[Lycopodium pulvinatum(Hook.et Grev.)Maxim.]"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-tj448tf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-tj448tf","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：全年均可采收，去根洗净，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-zlcalp7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-zlcalp7","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-sct67jk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-sct67jk","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：1.生于向阳山坡或岩石缝内。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-304s4fe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-304s4fe","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.多生于向阳的干旱岩石缝中。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-eh9opej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-eh9opej","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.分布于东北、华北、华东、中南及陕西、四川。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-ren6nii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-ren6nii","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.全国大部分地区有分布。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-ac9w6fj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-ac9w6fj","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-idxdiun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-idxdiun","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.卷柏，多年生草本，高5-15cm。主茎短或长，直立，下着须根。各枝丛生，直立，干后拳卷，密被覆瓦状叶，各枝扇状分枝至2-3回羽状分枝。叶小，异型，交互排列；侧叶披针状钻形，长约3mm，基部龙骨状，先端有长芒，远轴的一边全缘，宽膜质，近轴的一边膜质缘极狭，有微锯齿；中叶两行，卵圆披针形，长2mm，先端有长芒，斜向，左右两侧不等，边缘有微锯齿，中脉在叶上面下陷。孢子囊穗生于枝顶，四棱形；孢子叶三角形，先端有长芒，边缘有宽的膜质；孢子囊肾形，大小孢子的排列不规则。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-3m0yi1z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-3m0yi1z","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.垫状卷柏形态与卷柏相似，主要区别为根散生，不聚生成干，分枝多而密。腹叶并行，指向上方，肉质，全缘。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-jd55xjx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-jd55xjx","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-p1yen4x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-p1yen4x","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.生物学特性 喜光，具很强的抗旱能力，多生于向阳的山坡岩石上，或干旱的岩石缝中。在温度20℃左右潮湿的地方生长正常。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-iw0h120","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-iw0h120","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.栽培技术 分茎繁殖，有些种类可用叶片繁殖及孢子繁殖。分茎繁殖是将匍匐茎切成3-6cm长的茎段，放在细砂土上，每日浇水3-4次，保持湿润，即可成活。有些种类可将小叶片插到泥土中，浇水保湿，就能生根发出新叶。一些直立茎的种类，可用孢子繁殖，选取叶腑中长有成熟孢子囊的茎段，自枝顶切下1.5cm，置于排水良好的洁净土壤表面，土壤常用1份泥土加4份细砂混合而成，在茎段切口上洒些过筛的细土，保持切口的湿度，用玻璃加盖，防止失水，常保持潮湿，置于20℃左右温度条件下，约9个月后就能长出新株。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-vxq6lz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-vxq6lz2","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-vgfxnft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-vgfxnft","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.性状鉴别 全体紧缩如拳形，基部的须根大多已剪除，或剪短，仅留须根残基，或簇生众多棕色至棕黑色须根，长短不一，长者可达10cm。枝丛生，扁而有分枝，绿色或棕黄色，向内卷曲，枝上密生鳞片小叶，叶片卵形，长1.5-2.5mm，宽约1mm，先端锐尖，有浅绿色至浅棕色长芒，叶缘膜质，有不整齐的细锯齿，中叶斜列。质脆，易折断。无臭，味淡。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-wno1xcz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-wno1xcz","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.显微鉴别 茎横切面：表皮细胞1列，圆形或椭圆形，外壁稍增厚。其内为厚壁细胞层，占茎横切面的极大部分，近背、腹两侧各有1叶迹维管束；厚壁细胞含有红棕色物质。向内薄壁细胞排列疏松，内含油滴。内皮层不明显。维管束周韧型，3个并列，中央1个较大，呈新月形。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-q0hefv1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-q0hefv1","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶表面观：上下表皮细胞相似，狭长形，垂周壁近平直或略弯曲，平周壁光滑，气孔附近表皮细胞近等径形。气孔不定式，分布于上下表皮沿中脉附近，上表皮分布较少。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-0cx2hx3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-0cx2hx3","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-9eykmqc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-9eykmqc","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 全草含苏铁双黄酮（sotetsuflavone），穗花杉双黄酮（amentoflavone），扁柏双黄酮（hinokiflavone），异柳杉双黄酮（isocryptomerin），柳杉双黄酮（cryptomerin）B，芹菜素（apigenin）和海藻糖（trehalose）等。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-3c2r9wd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-3c2r9wd","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-cramvhz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-cramvhz","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.抗癌作用： 对化学抗癌剂或放射治疗敏感瘤均有效；常用于绒毛膜上皮癌，恶性葡萄胎、鼻癌、肺癌、肝癌。试验证明：卷柏全草的热水提取物，用总细胞容积法测定，对小鼠肉瘤-180%抑制率为61.2%，乙醇提取物的抑制率为18.6%；本品体内实验，对小鼠艾氏腹水癌有一定的抑制作用，并能延长移植肿瘤动物的寿命。其同科植物石上柏（深绿卷柏）体外实验，亦有较高的抗癌活性的作用。临床实践观察：对瘤体较小的癌肿疗效最好。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-s7t983t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-s7t983t","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.止血作用： 卷柏炒用具有止血作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-s828bwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-s828bwc","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.抑菌作用：100%卷柏煎剂用平板打洞法，对金黄色葡萄球菌有抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-rt1a51c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-rt1a51c","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.解痉作用：本品所含的芹菜甙元对平滑肌有中度解痉作用。经豚鼠和大鼠实验表明还有较弱的抗胃溃疡作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-nzp1i04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-nzp1i04","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-llcfbj6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-llcfbj6","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 卷柏炭：取洁净的卷柏，置锅内用武火炒至外表现焦黑色，内呈焦黄色，喷淋清水，取出，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-xxbhpsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-xxbhpsn","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-7f7ja40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-7f7ja40","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 取本品粉末2g，加甲醇50ml，回流1h，滤过。滤液回收溶剂至干。加无水乙醇2ml使溶。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-oesol29","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-oesol29","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）取上述溶液0.5ml，加乙醇稀释到3ml，加镁粉适量，再加浓盐酸0.5ml，加热5min，显红色。（检查黄酮）（2）薄层色谱 取上述溶液及溴酚蓝、甲基黄对照品液，分别点样于同一硅胶G-CMC板上，用异丙醇-浓氨水-水（13：1：1）展开，吹开后喷2%三氯化铝甲醇液，于紫外光灯（254nm）下观察，供试品色谱中在与对照品色谱的相应位置上，显相同的荧光斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-8hkb3l8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-8hkb3l8","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-9xfoj4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-9xfoj4f","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝；心经"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-3ox7f7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-3ox7f7m","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-mqschom","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-mqschom","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛；平；无毒"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-as8o0mz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-as8o0mz","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-udqou2u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-udqou2u","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 孕妇禁服"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-kvu14h3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-kvu14h3","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-uw507ws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-uw507ws","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 活血通经。主经闭；症瘕；跌打损伤；腹痛；哮喘；吐血；便血；尿血；衄血"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-gl0gljf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-gl0gljf","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-knwv1p5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-knwv1p5","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，4.5-10g。外用：适量，研末敷。。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-j49z4oa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-j49z4oa","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"临床应用"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-gpyijhd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-gpyijhd","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生用破血，炒用止血。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-12lxmus","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-12lxmus","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-8meioyc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-8meioyc","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草求真》：卷柏，其治有分生熟。生则微寒，力能破血通经，故治症瘕淋结等症；炙则辛温，能以止血，故治肠红脱肛等症，性与侧柏叶悬殊，治亦稍异，不可不辨。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-co8nu7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-co8nu7w","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本经》：主五脏邪气，女子阴中寒热痛、症瘕、血闭、绝子。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-3n498mr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-3n498mr","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《别录》：止咳逆，治脱肛，散淋结，头中风眩，瘘躄，强阴益精。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-co45fmk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-co45fmk","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《药性论》：治月经不通。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-1k5zii8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-1k5zii8","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《日华子本草》：镇心，除面皯，头风，暖水脏。生用破血，炙用止血。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-6k88lbb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-6k88lbb","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《分类草药性》：治跌打损伤，行气，炒黑止吐血。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-g0hbwbq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-g0hbwbq","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《现代实用中药》：治尿血。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-hgn5bc3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-hgn5bc3","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《安徽药材》：外用可治刀伤。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-e6a5ik4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-e6a5ik4","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《南宁市药物志》：治热性肠出血及子宫出血，外用接骨。"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-h9he8e3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-h9he8e3","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607113542-tyrbses","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113542-tyrbses","updated":"20240607113542"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607113544-qfzevld","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607113544-qfzevld"}},{"ID":"20240607113545-86gbhsc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607113545-86gbhsc"}}]}